{"synopsis":"Kim MinJun anak sekolah menengah biasa tibatiba dipanggil ke dunia lain yang membuatnya menjadi penyihir hitam\nDemi kembali ke dunia asalnya dia melewati berbagai kesulitan dan menyelamatkan dunia lain dengan kekuatan sihir hitam sebelum dia meninggalkan semua kekayaan dan kejayaannya sebagai pahlawan untuk kembali ke bumi\nNamun masalah muncul sebelum dia bisa menikmati kehidupannya yang baru di bumi Terdapat Dungeon dan monster yang memenuhi dunia dan mengancam harinya yang damai\nKarena itu MinJun yang baru kembali ke bumi tidak punya pilihan selain memasuki militer esok harinya","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"","artist":"","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c40ae66d-909e-4583-88a4-e87edfd8533f","number":"91","chapter":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7c962d13-a2a4-4481-ab37-f0cd9f146aff","number":"90","chapter":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2026-07-28","released":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"ab3cca98-f036-4344-9de1-90f1904ddd41","number":"89","chapter":"89","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"d1814421-86be-40c4-8330-4ecb4d8744c5","number":"88","chapter":"88","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"20bbb195-5145-438a-b60f-8e666a33348b","number":"87","chapter":"87","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"39019e74-a79d-4668-9994-ea949d205a1f","number":"86","chapter":"86","title":"Chapter 86","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b10ddade-7641-4a61-a449-8524c1c9afd5","number":"85","chapter":"85","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2026-06-22","released":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"5ad0e6a5-0cdd-45d0-8aec-f711b5fdf797","number":"84","chapter":"84","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2026-06-17","released":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"21da2247-78c9-4203-8383-096ae89485